{"id":"n49249-2-7","stage":4,"title":"소유자 · 所有人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49249-2-7-1","ko":"어쩌죠? 모르고 다른 사람의 자동차를 치었어요.","zh":"怎么办？我不知情的情况下撞到了别人的车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌죠?","meaning":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다：“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르고","meaning":"不知不觉","explanation":"모르다：不知不觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람의","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자동차를","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치었어요.","meaning":"撞，轧","explanation":"치다：撞，轧；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79272","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"91975","definition":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知不觉","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"在无意中不自觉地做出某种行为或说出某种话。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"撞，轧","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"79272","definition":"汽车等剧烈碰撞到人后直接开过去。","pronunciation":["치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f4a0f6447c3d4187b2f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49249-2-7-2","ko":"그럼 자동차의 소유자에게 연락을 해야겠어요.","zh":"那得联系一下车的车主才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자동차의","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소유자에게","meaning":"所有人","explanation":"소유자：所有人；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"소유자","audio":"/audio/e773fd6c6f12bc0fb149.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49249","senseId":"2","lemma":"소유자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연락을","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야겠어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"e773fd6c6f12bc0f","term":"소유자","zh":"所有人","audio":"/audio/e773fd6c6f12bc0fb149.mp3","entryId":"49249","definition":"法律上拥有某物的人。","pronunciation":["소ː유자"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ddee96df1503876f0c1f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49249","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那得联系一下车的车主才行。","今天啤酒馆里人真多啊。","怎么办？我不知情的情况下撞到了别人的车。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那得联系一下车的车主才行。","怎么办？我不知情的情况下撞到了别人的车。","今天啤酒馆里人真多啊。"],"answer":0}]}
